Received notification from DBMS server: <GqlStatusObject gql_status='01N52', status_description='warn: property key does not exist. The property `baggage_claim_at` does not exist. Verify that the spelling is correct.', position=<SummaryInputPosition line=2, column=59, offset=59>, raw_classification='UNRECOGNIZED', classification=<NotificationClassification.UNRECOGNIZED: 'UNRECOGNIZED'>, raw_severity='WARNING', severity=<NotificationSeverity.WARNING: 'WARNING'>, diagnostic_record={'_classification': 'UNRECOGNIZED', '_severity': 'WARNING', '_position': {'offset': 59, 'line': 2, 'column': 59}, 'OPERATION': '', 'OPERATION_CODE': '0', 'CURRENT_SCHEMA': '/'}> for query: '\nMATCH (p) WHERE (p:Passenger OR p:PassengerArchive) AND p.baggage_claim_at IS NOT NULL\n AND p.departed_airport_at IS NOT NULL\nWITH substring(p.departed_airport_at,0,10) AS day,\n duration.inSeconds(datetime(p.baggage_claim_at),datetime(p.departed_airport_at)).seconds/60.0 AS mins\nRETURN day, count(*) AS n, min(mins) AS min, percentileCont(mins,0.5) AS p50,\n       percentileCont(mins,0.9) AS p90, sum(CASE WHEN mins >= 45 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS timeout_sized\nORDER BY day\n'
